		(property "Description" "ST USBLC6-2SC6 2-line ESD array (SOT-23-6) for J6 PWM1/DIR1. Flow-through pinout: pins 1/6 = I/O1 (MOTOR1_PWM_CONN), 3/4 = I/O2 (MOTOR1_DIR_CONN). VBUS = +3V3 with 100 nF (C34). Place right at the connector."
